SKU-102590,Black Drinkware,Stainless Steel 304,350,Children 3+,Silicone,no,pass,pass,yes,yes
SKU-104123,Navy Drinkware,Stainless Steel 304,350,Children 3+,Silicone,yes,pass,pass,no,yes
SKU-104795,White Drinkware,Stainless Steel 201,350,Children 3+,Silicone,no,none on file,none on file,yes,no
SKU-105551,Denim Drinkware,Stainless Steel 304,350,Children 3+,Silicone,yes,pass,fail (painted exterior, lead 120 mg/kg),yes,yes

NOTES ON THE RANGE:
- Straw tips on SKU-104123 and SKU-105551 pull off and fit inside the small parts cylinder (choking hazard for under 3s and a small parts concern for 3+).
- SKU-104795 uses 201-grade steel and has no food contact or heavy metal test reports on file and no UKCA/CE documentation.
- SKU-104123 has no age warning or small parts statement on the pack.
- SKU-105551 failed the heavy metals test on the painted exterior.
- Bottle range is sold in the UK today; EU, US and Australia listings are planned.
